msgid "STORY_CHAPTER1"
msgstr "Chapter 1 · Pathfinder of Lumen Bay"

msgid "STORY_INTRO_1"
msgstr "Last night a storm swept through Lumen Bay."

msgid "STORY_INTRO_2"
msgstr "It knotted our wind-arrows, and the town's treasures got caught inside the tangles."

msgid "STORY_INTRO_3"
msgstr "Free the arrows one by one, little pathfinder. Every knot you open brings something home."

msgid "STORY_HARD_1"
msgstr "See the great apple tree? The storm tangled it hardest of all."

msgid "STORY_HARD_2"
msgstr "Take your time and look closely. Find the arrows that point to open sky first."

msgid "STORY_EXPERT_1"
msgstr "Even the harbor cat got caught. The tangles are getting deeper."

msgid "STORY_EXPERT_2"
msgstr "But you've already won back half the town. Keep going!"

msgid "STORY_MASTER_1"
msgstr "The heart of the storm is near. Now even the forest leaves are knotted."

msgid "STORY_MASTER_2"
msgstr "Only the last knots stand between us and the lighthouse light. Be brave!"

msgid "STORY_LEGEND_1"
msgstr "This is the last one. The town's heart is tied up in the deepest knot of all."

msgid "STORY_LEGEND_2"
msgstr "Untie it, and the lighthouse will shine again. I know you can."

msgid "STORY_END_1"
msgstr "You did it! The lighthouse is shining again."

msgid "STORY_END_2"
msgstr "Lumen Bay is awake again. Thank you, pathfinder."

msgid "STORY_END_3"
msgstr "But listen... a tangled wind is blowing from the Misty Forest. The next story begins soon."

